ts/steam/apps/1194680/extras/d429cdf1c3b254a16aefacc5f6c9ccba.mp4?t=1581461607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game unfolds on a large map. There are restaurants, an attraction, a telepherical, a ferris wheel, many animal pens, toilets, a shop, a veterinarian... The use of vehicles is therefore important to move faster, ride a camel, drive a vehicle or cling to it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194680/extras/e2f9224e61c3a03fbbe83db4264c30df.poster.avif?t=1581461607\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194680/extras/e2f9224e61c3a03fbbe83db4264c30df.webm?t=1581461607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194680/extras/e2f9224e61c3a03fbbe83db4264c30df.mp4?t=1581461607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can play up to 6 players in the same game.",
